      "review_summary": "The PR threads Discord reply policy metadata through some outbound send options and changes media caption follow-up chunks to omit `replyTo`.\n\nPR surface: Source +14. Total +14 across 4 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. source-reproducible: current and PR-head `sendDiscordText` build every physical chunk with the same `replyTo`, and the linked issue includes instrumented Discord request logs. I did not run a live Discord reproduction in this read-only review.",
